      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I smashed through the silence, my voice a thunderous roar that made his ears ring. He stumbled back, stunned, and I pressed on, my words like boulders tumbling down a cliff, overwhelming him. Success was a crushing weight on his shoulders, a heavy burden of weakness.",
