    {
      "Seq": 25,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I notice Aeemilyus, the brewer of the coast, as he taps a cask and sniffs the froth, brow furrowed in judgement. His scrutiny mirrors my childhood when a tutor would assess my understanding of geometry without me having anything in front of me. Already asking questions before I had even begun to speak. He takes careful note of what I am wearing and carrying, just as a strict tutor once did, though the setting and the urgency are different.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 26,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I sense a man tapping a cask, nostrils flaring as he sniffs the froth, brow furrowed in scrutiny. The only one without a cup or vessel in hand, already probing me with unspoken questions before I have even arrived. He takes careful note of my attire and carry, drawing me in. What does he know of this place and his work? The welcome and care of guests and travellers will guide me.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 27,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I greet him warmly, sit him down, and with a gentle touch of my hand, offer a steaming mug of ale. As he accepts it, I ask softly, \u0027What tales does your journey bear? And tell me, what do you know of this place?\u0027 It is done! This conversation opens the door to deeper understanding and connection.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "ask him what he knows of his work and of this place",
      "Succeeded": true
    },
